WEBVTT

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:02.725
Your March report arrives on April 18,

00:00:02.745 --> 00:00:04.725
34 days late.

00:00:06.033 --> 00:00:11.345
By then, $9,301.60 of ad budget is already spent.

00:00:12.633 --> 00:00:15.109
And seven logins give you seven different answers about

00:00:15.129 --> 00:00:16.877
how many leads you got.

00:00:18.167 --> 00:00:21.761
DealerEdge wires every source into one live platform.

00:00:23.067 --> 00:00:25.546
Every morning, you get the answer in plain English.

00:00:27.067 --> 00:00:29.442
Every sold unit traces back to its campaign:

00:00:29.517 --> 00:00:32.004
$38.50 of ad spend,

00:00:32.024 --> 00:00:36.094
to a $162,900 model.

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:39.888
One dealer sold 12 more units in a quarter,

00:00:39.908 --> 00:00:45.313
about $168,000 in margin the clicks never showed.

00:00:47.267 --> 00:00:49.560
Book a demo with DealerEdge.
